===Etymology===
{{word|en|ine|né}}{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₂ey-|id1=life|*kʷ-}}
Alteration (after {{m|en|either}}) of {{m|en|nauther}}, from {{inh|en|enm|neiþer}}, from {{inh|en|ang|nāwþer}}, contraction of {{m|ang|nāhwæþer}}, corresponding to {{m|en|no}} + {{m|en|whether}}. Compare {{noncog|la|neuter|t=neither}}. {{surf|+com|en|not|either}}.

